title: dream_start_d0
---
<<allowMovement Player false>>
<<setSpecialState Player CUTSCENEPAUSE >>
<<playAnimation Player FALLSPIN>>
<<spawn TransitionCanvas Start>>
===
title: dream_jump
---
<<setdialogue DialogueCanvas expo >>
Jump.:Z or Cross
<<set $sdream_jump to true>>
===
title: dream_interact
---
<<setdialogue DialogueCanvas expo >>
Interact.:X or Square
<<set $sdream_interact to true>>
===
title: dream_getup
---
<<playAnimation Player FLOOR>>
<<yarnoff YarnController playerTrail>>
<<set $sdream_getup to true>>
<<setdialogue DialogueCanvas expo >>
Move.:Left stick or arrow keys
<<wait  0.5>>
<<setSpecialState Player CUTSCENE >>
===